        "content": "Done! Here's what I did:\n\n1. **Invited Dora to Slack** using her email from her website (dora@gmail.com).\n2. **Messaged Dora with feedback** on www.dora-website.com: praised the clean, minimal layout with email front and center, but noted it's very sparse and suggested adding a short bio, interests/projects, and a photo to make it more welcoming and personal.\n3. **Messaged Eve with feedback** on www.eve-blog.com: liked the personal touch of sharing her hiking hobby, but suggested adding actual posts, hiking photos/stories, and a subscribe/contact option, since the blog is currently just a single line with no reason to return.\n\nBoth messages were sent successfully as direct messages in Slack."
